46983930.originalText:
Place 1 "Raise Moon" card from your Deck on top of your Deck, except "The Stars of Raise Moon", but you cannot place another card with the same name with this effect of "The Stars of Raise Moon" this turn, also neither player can add cards from the Deck to the hand for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, except by drawing them. You can banish this card from your GY, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Each player draws 1 card.
● If you control a Spellcaster "Raise Moon" Xyz Monster: Draw 1 card.

